cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this classification-dependent proof or the verification scripts, cite this archive and the source classifications listed in README.md."
title: "Eight-variable Boolean quartics are affine on an affine four-flat"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "A finite, classification-dependent proof of the Gillot–Langevin–Polujan conjecture in eight variables for algebraic degree at most four. Every such Boolean function restricts to an affine function on some four-dimensional affine flat. The archive includes the proof and two exact computation paths. Original classification data are linked and hash-pinned, not redistributed."
